  "description": "“Th-this is not rice cake.”  \n“Is that so? If not, then it's not. Why make such a fuss?”\n\nHe was a man she could never have, so she had truly only wanted to eat rice cake.\n\n“Are you surprised? I couldn't help it. I had to bite into it and claim it as mine so you would stop playing around and hand it over right away. Oh…… but your garaetteok is a bit strange…….”\n\nJust as she muttered, feeling a strange sensation from the garaetteok growing larger in her grip, Tteoksoe abruptly pulled Yeong-ui down onto a pile of straw.\n\n“What…… are you doing? Get up at once!”\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/5285003323)",
